038900     MOVE   ANSI-REFERENCE TO INF-ANSI-REFERENCE.                 NC1084.2
039000     MOVE   XXINFO TO DUMMY-RECORD. PERFORM WRITE-LINE 2 TIMES.   NC1084.2
