042400         WRITE DUMMY-RECORD AFTER ADVANCING PAGE                  NC1184.2
042500         MOVE CCVS-H-1  TO DUMMY-RECORD  PERFORM WRT-LN 2 TIMES   NC1184.2
042600         MOVE CCVS-H-2A TO DUMMY-RECORD  PERFORM WRT-LN 2 TIMES   NC1184.2
