026700     MOVE CCVS-C-2 TO DUMMY-RECORD. PERFORM WRITE-LINE 2 TIMES.   NC1224.2
026800     MOVE HYPHEN-LINE TO DUMMY-RECORD. PERFORM WRITE-LINE.        NC1224.2
