028200  END-ROUTINE-12.                                                 NC1224.2
028300      MOVE "TEST(S) FAILED" TO ENDER-DESC.                        NC1224.2
028400     IF       ERROR-COUNTER IS EQUAL TO ZERO                      NC1224.2
028500         MOVE "NO " TO ERROR-TOTAL                                NC1224.2
028600         ELSE                                                     NC1224.2
