028900     PERFORM WRITE-LINE.                                          NC1224.2
029000 END-ROUTINE-13.                                                  NC1224.2
029100     IF DELETE-COUNTER IS EQUAL TO ZERO                           NC1224.2
029200         MOVE "NO " TO ERROR-TOTAL  ELSE                          NC1224.2
