029400     MOVE "TEST(S) DELETED     " TO ENDER-DESC.                   NC1224.2
029500     MOVE CCVS-E-2 TO DUMMY-RECORD. PERFORM WRITE-LINE.           NC1224.2
029600      IF   INSPECT-COUNTER EQUAL TO ZERO                          NC1224.2
