034400     IF SUB-1 EQUAL TO 11 GO TO CHECK-ENTRIES.                    NC1364.2
034500     MOVE GRP-NAME TO ENTRY-1 (SUB-1).                            NC1364.2
034600     ADD 1 TO ADD-GRP.                                            NC1364.2
034700                                                                  NC1364.2
