036200             PERFORM PASS                                         NC1384.2
036300             GO TO SEP-WRITE-001.                                 NC1384.2
036400         PERFORM FAIL.                                            NC1384.2
036500         GO TO SEP-FAIL-001.                                      NC1384.2
