037900     IF TEMP EQUAL TO 7                                           NC1384.2
038000             PERFORM PASS                                         NC1384.2
038100             GO TO SEP-WRITE-002.                                 NC1384.2
038200         PERFORM FAIL.                                            NC1384.2
038300         GO TO SEP-FAIL-002.                                      NC1384.2
