038800     MOVE TEMP TO COMPUTED-18V0.                                  NC1384.2
038900     MOVE 7 TO CORRECT-18V0.                                      NC1384.2
039000 SEP-WRITE-002.                                                   NC1384.2
039100     MOVE "SEP-TEST-002" TO PAR-NAME.                             NC1384.2
039200     PERFORM PRINT-DETAIL.                                        NC1384.2
