022200     MOVE     SPACE TO RE-MARK.                                   NC1414.2
022300 HEAD-ROUTINE.                                                    NC1414.2
022400     MOVE CCVS-H-1  TO DUMMY-RECORD. PERFORM WRITE-LINE 2 TIMES.  NC1414.2
