038700     MOVE CCVS-E-3 TO DUMMY-RECORD. PERFORM WRITE-LINE.           NC1704.2
038800 WRITE-LINE.                                                      NC1704.2
038900     ADD 1 TO RECORD-COUNT.                                       NC1704.2
