037400     MOVE     CCVS-E-2 TO DUMMY-RECORD.                           NC1714.2
037500     PERFORM WRITE-LINE.                                          NC1714.2
037600 END-ROUTINE-13.                                                  NC1714.2
037700     IF DELETE-COUNTER IS EQUAL TO ZERO                           NC1714.2
