048000     IF RECORD-COUNT GREATER 42                                   NC1744.2
048100         MOVE DUMMY-RECORD TO DUMMY-HOLD                          NC1744.2
048200         MOVE SPACE TO DUMMY-RECORD                               NC1744.2
