048500         MOVE CCVS-H-2A TO DUMMY-RECORD  PERFORM WRT-LN 2 TIMES   NC1744.2
048600         MOVE CCVS-H-2B TO DUMMY-RECORD  PERFORM WRT-LN 3 TIMES   NC1744.2
