051300     MOVE "ADD" TO FEATURE.                                       NC1764.2
051400     MOVE "VI-74 6.6.4 GR4" TO ANSI-REFERENCE.                    NC1764.2
051500 ADD-TEST-F1-1.                                                   NC1764.2
051600     ADD      N-5 TO N-7.                                         NC1764.2
