072900     PERFORM14 (2, 14) EQUAL TO 45.0 AND PERFORM14 (2, 20)        NC2014.2
073000     EQUAL TO 50.0 AND PERFORM2 EQUAL TO 2 AND PERFORM3           NC2014.2
073100     EQUAL TO 1 AND XRAY EQUAL TO "A" PERFORM PASS                NC2014.2
