039600     MOVE   SPACES TO COR-ANSI-REFERENCE.                         NC2034.2
039700 FAIL-ROUTINE-EX. EXIT.                                           NC2034.2
039800 BAIL-OUT.                                                        NC2034.2
039900     IF     COMPUTED-A NOT EQUAL TO SPACE GO TO BAIL-OUT-WRITE.   NC2034.2
