044200     MOVE "TEST(S) DELETED     " TO ENDER-DESC.                   NC2044.2
044300     MOVE CCVS-E-2 TO DUMMY-RECORD. PERFORM WRITE-LINE.           NC2044.2
044400      IF   INSPECT-COUNTER EQUAL TO ZERO                          NC2044.2
