034900      MOVE CCVS-E-2 TO DUMMY-RECORD. PERFORM WRITE-LINE.          NC2104.2
035000     MOVE CCVS-E-3 TO DUMMY-RECORD. PERFORM WRITE-LINE.           NC2104.2
