035800     MOVE                  "B" TO B-AN-1.                         NC2154.2
035900 SEQ-TEST-GF-2.                                                   NC2154.2
036000     IF H-AN-1 < I-AN-1 AND J-AN-1 > B-AN-1 PERFORM PASS          NC2154.2
036100         ELSE                                                     NC2154.2
