044400     PERFORM PRINT-DETAIL.                                        NC2184.2
044500*                                                                 NC2184.2
044600 UST-TEST-GF-1-5.                                                 NC2184.2
044700     ADD     1 TO REC-CT.                                         NC2184.2
044800     IF      ID11-DU-2V0 = 1                                      NC2184.2
044900             PERFORM PASS                                         NC2184.2
