034700*    COLLATING SEQUENCE FOLLOWED IN ASCENDING ORDER BY THE        NC2194.2
034800*    LETTER  U.  THIS IS SHOWN IN THE ALPHABET-NAME               NC2194.2
034900*    COLLATING-SEQ-1.                                             NC2194.2
035000*                                                                 NC2194.2
