040400*    HIGH-VALUE BUT NOT EQUAL TO THE **NEW** HIGH-VALUE.          NC2194.2
040500*                                                                 NC2194.2
040600*            N SHOULD NOT = HIGH-VALUE.                           NC2194.2
040700*                                                                 NC2194.2
040800*                                                                 NC2194.2
