027600     MOVE     SPACE TO RE-MARK.                                   NC2214.2
027700 HEAD-ROUTINE.                                                    NC2214.2
027800     MOVE CCVS-H-1  TO DUMMY-RECORD. PERFORM WRITE-LINE 2 TIMES.  NC2214.2
