032400         WRITE DUMMY-RECORD AFTER ADVANCING PAGE                  NC2214.2
032500         MOVE CCVS-C-1 TO DUMMY-RECORD PERFORM WRT-LN             NC2214.2
032600         MOVE CCVS-C-2 TO DUMMY-RECORD PERFORM WRT-LN 2 TIMES     NC2214.2
