040800     MOVE "TALLY FOR CHAR AFTER" TO FEATURE.                      NC2214.2
040900     MOVE ZEROS TO TABLE2.                                        NC2214.2
041000     SET INDEX1 TO 2.                                             NC2214.2
041100     SET INDEX2 TO 2.                                             NC2214.2
041200 INS-TEST-F1-2.                                                   NC2214.2
