026300     IF P-OR-F EQUAL TO "FAIL*"  PERFORM WRITE-LINE               NC2324.2
026400        PERFORM FAIL-ROUTINE THRU FAIL-ROUTINE-EX                 NC2324.2
026500          ELSE PERFORM BAIL-OUT THRU BAIL-OUT-EX.                 NC2324.2
