029200 BLANK-LINE-PRINT.                                                NC2354.2
029300     PERFORM WRT-LN.                                              NC2354.2
029400 FAIL-ROUTINE.                                                    NC2354.2
029500     IF   COMPUTED-X NOT EQUAL TO SPACE GO TO FAIL-ROUTINE-WRITE. NC2354.2
