031400     MOVE   ANSI-REFERENCE TO INF-ANSI-REFERENCE.                 NC2364.2
031500     MOVE   XXINFO TO DUMMY-RECORD. PERFORM WRITE-LINE 2 TIMES.   NC2364.2
031600     MOVE   SPACES TO INF-ANSI-REFERENCE.                         NC2364.2
