027400     IF P-OR-F EQUAL TO "FAIL*"  PERFORM WRITE-LINE               NC2384.2
027500        PERFORM FAIL-ROUTINE THRU FAIL-ROUTINE-EX                 NC2384.2
027600          ELSE PERFORM BAIL-OUT THRU BAIL-OUT-EX.                 NC2384.2
