028100 HEAD-ROUTINE.                                                    NC2384.2
028200     MOVE CCVS-H-1  TO DUMMY-RECORD. PERFORM WRITE-LINE 2 TIMES.  NC2384.2
028300     MOVE CCVS-H-2A TO DUMMY-RECORD. PERFORM WRITE-LINE 2 TIMES.  NC2384.2
