027700      MOVE CCVS-E-2 TO DUMMY-RECORD PERFORM WRITE-LINE.           NC2404.2
027800  END-ROUTINE-12.                                                 NC2404.2
027900      MOVE "TEST(S) FAILED" TO ENDER-DESC.                        NC2404.2
