028500     PERFORM WRITE-LINE.                                          NC2404.2
028600 END-ROUTINE-13.                                                  NC2404.2
028700     IF DELETE-COUNTER IS EQUAL TO ZERO                           NC2404.2
028800         MOVE "NO " TO ERROR-TOTAL  ELSE                          NC2404.2
