159300     MOVE     ZERO TO WRK-DS-0201P.                               NC2524.2
159400     COMPUTE  WRK-DS-0201P ROUNDED = A05ONES-DS-05V00 / 5         NC2524.2
159500              ON SIZE ERROR                                       NC2524.2
